---
description: Rules for any agent building the final cloud submission on this foundation
alwaysApply: true
---

Before changing this repository:

1. Read `AGENTS.md`.
2. Read `docs/SKILLS.md`.
3. Read every file in `docs/brief/` when a question is present.
4. Extend the reference-record slice. Do not replace the project layout.
5. Never commit connection strings, passwords, publish profiles, or local `.db` files.
6. Chat may be terse. README, Razor copy, commits, and documents a lecturer will read stay in normal English.
